      47.98,
      441.31,
      542.51,
      466.45
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sections 3 & 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I. Dr. Ramesh Pathirana, Minister of Ministry of Industries, do by this notification ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.98,
      477.31,
      542.52,
      514.45
    ],
    "text": "01. Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cSiyambalagoda Nelumvila viharastha agamika ha subhasadana samithiya\u201d situated No. 183/A, Nelumwila Viharaya, Siyambalagoda, Polgasowita as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.98,
      525.31,
      542.52,
      550.45
    ],
    "text": "02. Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision of Section 5(4) of that Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
